hat it is  against their protocol but after kim  leaves he enters the hole and retrieves  the bag with the help of one of his  colleagues after this he searches  through the bag and finds an identity  card which shows that kim is a doctor  just then the phone inside starts  ringing and jiku answers it hesitantly  kim's daughter me roo is on the other  side and after a small chat jiku agrees  to meet her after school meanwhile two  brothers byung ki and bieng approach the  container with the illegal immigrants  when they open it they are taken aback  to find everyone dead all except for one  there is also a very powerful stench  inside the container confused about what  to do the brothers take videos of the  scene and put the lone survivor inside  their truck after a while they stop at a  grocery store and bianchi heads inside  to get some supplies sensing the  opportunity the survivor makes a run for  it when bianchi returns from the store  he notices that the man has escaped and  that his brother is coughing profusely  he tries chasing the survivor but  ultimately gives up and instead takes  his brother to a clinic there the doctor  gives bieng woo some normal  prescriptions and asks him to rest but  biengmu cannot stop coughing he spreads  his droplets to all the people in his  vicinity elsewhere jiku visits meru  outside her school and tries to start a  conversation but just like her mother  meeru refuses to interact she simply  takes her mother's bag and jiku's  business card before leaving as jiku is  headed home he notices some people  coughing vigorously on the bus nearby  following this we are shown a montage of  how the virus is slowly taking over the  city of bandang later when kim reaches  home she gets ecstatic to find that her  bag has been returned she hugs her  daughter with joy and also thanks jiku  for his help just as the mother-daughter  duo is bonding kim gets a call from her  hospital informing her that there has  been a sudden emergency left with no  other options she leaves meeru in the  care of her grandmother when kim arrives  at the hospital she notices that  everyone is scared she immediately heads  into the emergency room where byeong-woo  the patient is in a critical state he  has coughed up a lot of blood and has  red rashes on his body kim deduces that  it is avian flu and tells her seniors  about it but they are not convinced soon  after the doctors get a hold of  byeongwu's phone and find the footage of  the container filled with dead bodies  they are sure that the virus originated  from there and approached the patient's  brother bianchi to ask about it but he  remains silent suddenly an emergency  alarm starts blaring and this makes  bianchi anxious despite the doctor's  warning he wrestles everyone and rushes  into the emergency room only to find  that his brother has passed away  devastated he breaks down and hugs his  brother causing his hands to get stained  with blood bianchi then touches several  of the doctors with his hands but after  a long struggle he is finally subdued in  the next scene meeru gets bored and  ventures out of her house alone she is  almost hit by a vehicle but monsai the  survivor from the container saves her  meru notices that he is hungry and  provides him with some food as they talk  mansai warns the little girl to stay  away from him since he is sick but meru  continues talking to him a while later  monsae starts coughing prompting mirou  to get some aid she calls jiku for help  but by the time he arrives  mansai is already gone by this time  thousands of people in the city have  become infected by the virus resulting  in the hospitals becoming overcrowded  with patients on the other hand kim  along with a team of the kcdc the korea  centers for disease control and  prevention locate the container and  incinerate all the dead bodies inside  kcdc is playing their hit song tnt  however a large swarm of rats that had  been feeding on the corpses manages to  escape 